[00:13.39]Sorry now, I guess that this is Good Bye.
{"抱歉此刻 我想这便是告别时分"}
[00:19.30]Hard to say the precious words,
{"那些珍贵的话语 总是难以启齿"}
[00:22.84]I never said to you.
{"我从未对你倾诉"}
[00:26.07]Now today, tomorrow and everyday.
{"从今往后 每个今日明日与朝夕"}
[00:32.34]How am I gonna let you go?
{"我该如何放手让你离去"}
[00:35.19]What am I going to do?
{"我又该如何自处"}
[00:39.25]Crying out for the moon that I have never known.
{"为从未知晓的月光恸哭"}
[00:45.45]I've only lived under an empty sky.
{"我始终活在虚无苍穹之下"}
[00:52.74]I thought this happiness was something I could own.
{"曾以为这份幸福能永远紧握"}
[00:58.70]Oh, why was I so blind?
{"为何我竟如此盲目"}
[01:04.16]
[01:05.79]Whatever you lost and maybe whatever you found.
{"无论你失去什么 或寻得何物"}
[01:11.83]Now, you're moving on without it,
{"此刻你正放下过往前行"}
[01:15.05]don't let your heart get down.
{"别让心沉入低谷"}
[01:18.70]If you look beyond, then you can see it in your mind.
{"若你极目远眺 便能望见心中景象"}
[01:25.08]This simple treasure, it isn't so hard to find.
{"这简单的珍宝 其实并不难寻获"}
[01:34.60]
[01:45.14]Best of luck, don't give up and you'll be fine.
{"祝君好运 别放弃 你会安然无恙"}
[01:51.23]It's hard to see your Smiling face
{"我难以直视你微笑的脸庞"}
[01:54.56]when I know the tears you're hiding.
{"因知晓你隐藏的泪光"}
[01:58.15]Listening now, the busy streets, they come alive.
{"此刻聆听 繁忙街道渐次苏醒"}
[02:04.28]And the blue sky starts to fade we just keep trying.
{"当蓝天褪色 我们仍坚持前行"}
[02:11.95]Giving up on everything, I used to be.
{"放弃曾经那个完整的自己"}
[02:17.45]Can't fake a smile, that's not who I want to be.
{"强颜欢笑 非我所愿"}
[02:24.74]Went looking for a simple truth
{"我曾追寻一个简单的真相"}
[02:27.34]that I couldn't seem to find.
{"却始终遍寻不得"}
[02:30.81]Oh, why was I so blind?
{"为何我竟如此盲目"}
[02:36.21]
[02:37.87]Whatever you lost and maybe whatever you found.
{"无论你失去什么　又或许寻获什么"}
[02:43.92]Now, you're moving on without it,
{"此刻你已放下前行"}
[02:47.07]don't let your heart get down.
{"别让心沉入低谷"}
[02:50.50]If you look beyond, then you can see it in your mind.
{"若你望向更远处　就能在脑海中看见"}
[02:57.04]This simple treasure, it isn't so hard to find.
{"这份简单的珍宝　其实并不难寻"}
[03:07.71]
[03:29.79]Oh, would somebody bring me back again.
{"哦　谁能带我重回往日时光"}
[03:36.25]To the dreams and love I thought I lost.
{"回到我以为已逝的梦境与爱里"}
[03:42.60]If I could touch the sky, hold it in my hand.
{"若我能触碰天际　将它握在手心"}
[03:48.47]Take it in my heart and let it shine on us.
{"纳入心房　让它为我们闪耀"}
[03:56.84]Whatever you lost and maybe whatever you found.
{"无论你失去什么　又或许寻获什么"}
